    "description": {
      "value": "Made from soft leather, with delicate white wings attached to the heel, these boots are ensorcelled with powerful air magic. Whenever you fall while wearing these boots, the boots automatically cast feather fall on you. This benefit can't trigger again for 10 minutes.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou speak a command word and click the boots' heels together to cause the wings to animate and flap rapidly, granting you a fly Speed of 30 feet for 10 minutes."
